<title>USA: Lehman Brothers wins $125 million Washington GOs.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers wins $125 million Washington GOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $125 million of Washington State various purpose general obligation refunding bonds, Series R-98A, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.07 percent.</p>
</text>
